OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FBright
OL,6,Fand sunny for most on Monday with
OL,7,Flight winds. Cloudier and breezier on
OL,8,FTuesday, with overnight rain. Sunny
OL,9,Fspells on Wednesday with the odd
OL,10,Fshower. Above average daytime
OL,11,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
